  "prefLabel": "Hab 201.11 Conduct of Parties, Attorneys, Agents and Municipal Consultants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hab 201.11 Conduct of Parties, Attorneys, Agents and Municipal Consultants.\n\n(a) Parties, attorneys, agents, and municipal consultants shall conduct themselves in a truthful and respectful manner in all of their dealings with the board and other parties, attorneys, municipal consultants, and agents.\n\nSource. #13226 eff 7-7-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hab100-300.html"
